--- a/docs/skills/repository-operations.md
+++ b/docs/skills/repository-operations.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+Keep historical fixture bindings keyed by path and content hash. When a live
+fixture changes, verify the old row against its original qualified config and
+immutable Git/snapshot bytes; bind the current live fixture separately.
+Explicit pytest basetemp and retention settings do not isolate robocorp-log
+output: its installed plugin defaults to `./output`. Pass
+`--robocorp-log-output` with an absent directory below the owned run root and
+reject existing paths or symlinks. Bind the shared generated log bodies and
+nanosecond file metadata before and in the always-run post guard to detect
+accidental writes; never relabel historical generated-output bindings.
